@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai hop le cho bai tap 1 - 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200458/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo Id - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Nop bai thieu du lieu - 400 Bad Request (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Nop vao bai tap da dong - 400 Bad Request (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200458/CNTTK23D"
}

### 8. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai - 404 Not Found (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200458/CNTTK23D"
}

### 9. Nop trung sinh vien cho cung bai tap - 409 Conflict (DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200458/CNTTK23D"
}

### 10. Xoa luot nop vua tao - 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
